10	// Genuinely different instants — even a single nanosecond apart, or the same
11	// clock reading under different offsets — fail the whole line as a value
12	// conflict. Validity is judged before any comparison: a fraction longer
13	// than nine digits is a format error even when the excess digits are zeros
14	// whose truncation would make the two values equal.
